OL,3,AFather's house rammed before son died
OL,4,Ain A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said that in the early hours
OL,7,Fof Saturday, and the previous night, it
OL,8,Fhad received multiple reports of two
OL,9,Fcars driving dangerously around the
OL,10,Ftown and a Volvo XC60, believed to be
OL,11,Flinked to the Passat, was seen ramming
OL,12,Fproperties.
OL,14,FThere is no suggestion Worthy's father
OL,15,Fwas involved in criminal activity.
